        dcterms:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "The module docstring states P1-P3 and E1-E8 with Thompson page numbers; every model function's docstring names its equation; the Lean header maps each theorem to an equation and to script function names; the KG yaml links code loci by function name. Deductions: code loci are by function name, not line range; the segmentation thresholds (90, 400, 1500, fill 0.9) are not traced to anything but the plate." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-024-code-traceability-1>,
